            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Now I have to start over - the fight totally harshed the vibes there. No worries, I can do it. You've just got to be more careful, you know?",
